  advisory GPU 1: S12_stenosis_yolo11l — S8 recipe + yolo11l-seg (larger model) for stenosis; syntax stays yolo11m
  advisory GPU 2: S13_mixup_mosaic_stack — S8 recipe + mixup=0.15 on stenosis (mixup + mosaic complementary regularisation)
  advisory GPU 3: S15_s8_seed42 — S8 recipe with seed=42 (variance study)
  advisory GPU 4: S15_s8_seed7 — S8 recipe with seed=7 (variance study)
  advisory GPU 5: S15_s8_seed2024 — S8 recipe with seed=2024 (variance study)
  advisory GPU 0: S16_mosaic_both — S8 + mosaic=0.5 on syntax too (stretch: test whether mosaic helps syntax too)
  advisory GPU 1: S18_s12_seed42 — S12 (yolo11l-seg) recipe with seed=42 (Round 4 variance confirmation)
  advisory GPU 2: S18_s12_seed7 — S12 (yolo11l-seg) recipe with seed=7 (Round 4 variance confirmation)
  advisory GPU 3: S18_s12_seed2024 — S12 (yolo11l-seg) recipe with seed=2024 (Round 4 variance confirmation)
  advisory GPU 4: S17_mosaic_crop_1024 — S8 mosaic + vessel-guided CROP + stenosis at 1024px (combines the two orthogonal Round 2 wins; highest-ceiling experiment)
  advisory GPU 5: S19_syntax_yolo11l — yolo11l-seg on SYNTAX (capacity upgrade, the S12 move applied to syntax)
  advisory GPU 0: S20_syntax_all25_eval12 — Train syntax on ALL 25 classes, evaluate mean only over kept-12 subset (exploits S9 per-class gains on classes 9/13/16)
  advisory GPU 1: S21_syntax_max_capacity — Kitchen-sink syntax: yolo11l + imgsz 1024 + patience 50 + freeze 5 (max capacity & exposure)
  advisory GPU 2: S22_syntax_yolo11l_all25 — S19 + S20 stack: yolo11l syntax trained on all 25 classes, eval on kept-12. Highest expected syntax gain this round.
  advisory GPU 3: S23_syntax_1024 — Syntax at imgsz=1024 (more pixels for thin distal branches, yolo11m unchanged)
  advisory GPU 4: S24_syntax_long — Longer syntax training: patience 50, freeze 5 (more unfrozen fine-tuning time)
  advisory GPU 5: S25_cls_loss_2x — S8 recipe + cls loss weight 0.5 -> 2.0 on SYNTAX model. Targets class-confusion bottleneck on tail classes 9/13/16.
  advisory GPU 0: S26_lesion_crops — S8 recipe + lesion-centric stenosis training. Train crops (256px, 3/lesion) blended with full images; val/test untouched. Attacks small-object bottleneck directly via effective-resolution upsampling.
  advisory GPU 1: S27_sgd_optimizer — S8 recipe + SGD (lr=0.01, wd=0.0005) replacing AdamW. YOLO's native optimizer; ultralytics reports SGD +1-3pp over AdamW on segmentation.
  advisory GPU 2: S28_sgd_cls075 — S27 SGD baseline + syntax cls=0.75
  advisory GPU 3: S29_sgd_cls100 — S27 SGD baseline + syntax cls=1.0
  advisory GPU 4: S30_sgd_cls125 — S27 SGD baseline + syntax cls=1.25
  advisory GPU 5: S31_sgd_lr005 — S27 SGD + lr0=0.005 (half LR)
  advisory GPU 0: S32_sgd_lr020 — S27 SGD + lr0=0.02 (double LR)
  advisory GPU 1: S33_sgd_wd001 — S27 SGD + weight_decay=0.001 (2x default)
  advisory GPU 2: S34_crops_sgd_long — S27 SGD + lesion crops (n=3, size=256) with longer training (epochs=250). Retries S26 on the hypothesis that crops were under-trained (4x more data, same epochs).
  advisory GPU 3: S35_crops_sgd_tight — S27 SGD + lesion crops (n=2, size=320). Bigger crops, less duplication — keeps more anatomical context per sample.
  advisory GPU 4: S36_sten_lr_half — S27 SGD, stenosis LR halved (0.005). Syntax stays at 0.01. Decoupled application of the Round 7 S31 finding.
  advisory GPU 5: S37_sten_1024 — S27 SGD + stenosis imgsz=1024, batch=4. Never-run S11 idea on top of the proven SGD baseline — more pixels for the small-object head.
  advisory GPU 0: S38_freeze_25 — S27 SGD + freeze_epochs=25 (vs 15 default). Longer head-only warmup before unfreezing the backbone. Untouched lever.
  advisory GPU 1: S39_s27_seed42 — S27 SGD recipe, seed=42 (variance study)
  advisory GPU 2: S40_s27_seed7 — S27 SGD recipe, seed=7 (variance study)
  advisory GPU 3: S41_s27_seed2024 — S27 SGD recipe, seed=2024 (variance study)
  advisory GPU 4: S42_sten_slow_1024 — S36 + S37 combined: S27 SGD base, stenosis at 1024px with halved LR (0.005). Stacks both Round 8 orthogonal bets if they win solo. Highest ceiling of Round 8.
  advisory GPU 5: S43a_no_mosaic — S36 recipe minus mosaic (copy_paste stays 0.3). Ablation arm 1: does mosaic hurt stenosis?
  advisory GPU 0: S43b_no_cp — S36 recipe minus copy_paste (mosaic stays 0.8). Ablation arm 2: does copy_paste hurt stenosis?
  advisory GPU 1: S43c_no_both — S36 recipe minus BOTH mosaic and copy_paste (Medipixel-style conservative aug). Ablation arm 3 — the unified 'less-is-more' hypothesis.
  advisory GPU 2: S44_ssass_port — Full port of Medipixel's SSASS supervised recipe (ARCADE 1st, F1=0.5699): stenosis at 640px, SGD lr=0.01, 300 epochs, no mosaic/cp, conservative geometric + HSV aug, patience=50. Target ≥0.52 stenosis F1. Overnight experiment.

